seed = 41209

; 3. THE DEAD PANEL — emissive-only fallback, mounted on the wall above the
; console. Its ballast is gone: it glows and it lights nothing. Deliberately in
; the same frame as the working one so the degrade can be judged rather than
; taken on trust.
